{
  "title": "IMO 1981 第3题：整数约束下的最大值",
  "cells": [
    {
      "mode": "markdown",
      "code": "# IMO 1981 第3题：整数约束下的最大值\n\n整数 m、n 均属于 {1,2,…,1981}，且 $(n^2-mn-m^2)^2=1$。求 $m^3+n^3$ 的最大值。\n\n## 求候选值并完整枚举\n\n先让 Calix 解出约束方程中的 n，再逐一检查全部 1981 个 m 和约束右侧的两种符号。输出全部可行整数对、目标函数的最大值及达到最大值的整数对。下方的点图显示所有可行解。",
      "id": "case-15-0"
    },
    {
      "mode": "source",
      "code": "Clear[m,n,s₂,c₁,r₁₂];\nb₆=SolveValues[n^2-m*n-m^2==s₂,n];\np₃=Flatten[Table[\n  c₁=(m+Sqrt[5*m^2+4*s₂])/2;\n  If[IntegerQ[c₁] && c₁>=1 && c₁<=1981,{m,c₁},Nothing],\n  {m,1,1981},{s₂,{-1,1}}\n],1];\ns₁=Table[Part[r₁₂,1]^3+Part[r₁₂,2]^3,{r₁₂,p₃}];\nb₂=Max[s₁];\nw₁=Table[If[Part[r₁₂,1]^3+Part[r₁₂,2]^3==b₂,r₁₂,Nothing],{r₁₂,p₃}];\nColumn[{\n  Labeled[b₆,\"n(m), two algebraic roots\"],\n  Labeled[p₃,\"all feasible integer pairs {m,n}, 1...1981\"],\n  Labeled[b₂,\"maximum m^3+n^3\"],\n  Labeled[w₁,\"maximizing integer pairs {m,n}\"],\n  Labeled[ListPlot[p₃],\"all feasible pairs, horizontal m and vertical n\"]\n}]",
      "id": "case-15-1"
    },
    {
      "mode": "markdown",
      "code": "## 检查原约束与搜索范围\n\n将所有候选对代回原题约束，并检查坐标范围。枚举对每个 m 检查了两个可能的正根；另一个代数根不大于零，不属于题设范围。",
      "id": "case-15-2"
    },
    {
      "mode": "source",
      "code": "r₁₀=Table[(Part[r₁₂,2]^2-Part[r₁₂,1]*Part[r₁₂,2]-Part[r₁₂,1]^2)^2-1,{r₁₂,p₃}];\nColumn[{\n  Labeled[r₁₀,\"original constraint residuals, all zero\"],\n  Labeled[{Min[Flatten[p₃]],Max[Flatten[p₃]]},\"smallest and largest coordinates in the feasible set\"],\n  Labeled[1981*2,\"number of exact candidate checks\"]\n}]",
      "id": "case-15-3"
    }
  ],
  "format": "calix-notebook",
  "version": 1
}